  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Say what time",
   "texto": [
    "After **o**, the form also changes: **o ósmej** means «8: 00.» and **o siódmej**, «at 7: 00».",
    "It is different from Spanish, where we usually maintain «8» and «seven»."
   ]
  },
